{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202509/t20250915_1349121.shtml","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:13.524426+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202509/t20250915_1349121.shtml","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<h2>武汉理工大学材料科学与工程学院2026年推荐免试攻读硕士学位（直接攻读博士学位）研究生招生简章</h2>\n<p>发布时间：2025-09-15</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><p><span><strong><span>一、申请条件</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>符合学校规定的基本条件。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>本科期间学习成绩、思想品德优秀，无违纪处分。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>接收所有获得所在学校推荐免试资格的应届本科毕业生报考。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年入学前获得本科毕业证书、学位证书。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>申请本科直博者，应具有较强的科研创新能力和培养潜力。</span></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>二、招生类别和招生人数</span></strong></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（一）本科直博生</span></span></strong></p><center><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/c5d2a2c1b8a05832ef13.png\" title=\"\"/></center><p><span><span>注：</span></span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>含武汉理工大学材料科学与工程国际化示范学院（材料与微电子学院）指标</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>    2</span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>本科直博生实际招生人数可根据实际情况做适当调整</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（二）硕士研究生</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/9c8171e6518eb558038c.png\" title=\"\"/></span></span></p><center></center><p><span><span><span>注：</span></span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>材料科学与工程</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>专业</span></span></span><span><span><span>含武汉理工大学材料科学与工程国际化示范学院</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>（材料与微电子学院）指标</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>    2</span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>硕士研究生实际招生人数可根据实际情况做适当调整</span></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>三、申请、复试、录取工作安排</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>我院组织预报名环节，请有意愿报考我院的推免生务必及时进行预报名。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>预报名阶段为2025年9月15日至</span></strong><span><strong><span><span>9</span>月<span>17</span>日<span>14:00</span></span></strong></span><span>，获得所在高校推免资格的考生，请通过预报名链接（http://whlg.form.360eol.com/enroll/325enOL3）填报志愿。我院对报名考生的材料进行审核后，通知符合条件的考生参加考核。</span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>预报名</span></span></span><span><span><span>考生需</span></span></span><span><span><span>提前准备好以下材料：</span></span></span><span><span><span>教育部学信网学籍验证报告、本科成绩单（加盖公章）、外语水平</span></span></span><span><span><span>成绩单或</span></span></span><span><span><span>证明、</span></span></span><span><span><span>推免资格证明（公示文件</span></span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span><span><span>截图，并做姓名标注）、</span></span></span><span><span><span>公开发表的科研水平和综合能力佐证材料（如正式发表的论文、授权</span></span></span><span><span><span>发明</span></span></span><span><span><span>专利、省级及以上获奖证书）等</span></span></span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>以“姓名</span></span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span><span><span>推免生</span></span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span><span><span>拟报考专业”命名，上传系统。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span>学院成立推免生复试专家小组，坚持贯彻公平、公正、公开的原则，落实集体议事和集体决策制度，以提高选拔质量为核心，完善全面考查。我院预计采用<span>电话面试</span>进行综合能力考核，</span><span><strong><span>考核时间预计为<span>9</span>月<span>18-19</span>日</span></strong></span><span>，如有变动另行通知。学院将在面试结束后，通过电子邮箱，择优向通过考核的学生发放预录取通知。</span></p><p><span><span>3.</span>对参加我院预报名并通过复试考核的考生，务必在教育部“推免服务系统”开放后<span>7</span>小时内（即<span><span>2025</span>年</span></span><strong><span><span>9</span>月<span>22</span>日<span>16:00</span></span></strong><span>前），登录中国研招网“推免服务系统”（网址：<span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span>）填报志愿，网上完成接收并确认我院的复试通知等。学院将依据报名顺序发放待录取通知，额满为止。逾期未正式报名的，则不能保证预留计划额度。</span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span>我院在中国研招网“推免服务系统”发放复试通知或待录取通知后，若超出规定时间考生未接受，且经学院电话确认后，可撤销对考生的待录取通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span>考生要在规定时间内通过中国研招网“推免服务系统”确认同意待录取，一旦操作不可更改。逾期未确认考生，视为放弃待录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span><span><span>针对预报名的考生录取结束后，如有计划余额，学院将根据中国研招网“推免服务系统”中的报名情况进行补录</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>并对考生进行</span></span><span><span>电话复试</span></span><span><span>考核，择优录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>7.</span></span></span><span><span>申请武汉理工大学材料科学与工程国际化示范学院（材料与微电子学院）免试推荐的</span></span><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>，申请、复试、录取工作由材料科学与工程国际化示范学院（材料与微电子学院）另行安排</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>四、注意事项</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>所有推免生</span></span><span><span><span>(</span></span></span><span><span>含硕士生、直博生</span></span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span><span><span>必须通过教育部推免服务系统完成所有的工作程序。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>考生应对提交材料的真实性负责</span></span><span><span>,</span></span><span><span>凡弄虚作假者一经发现即取消其考核或录取资格。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>五、联系方式</span></strong></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>联系人：</span></span></p><p><span><span>材料科学与工程学院</span></span><span><span><span>:</span></span></span><span><span>陈老师</span></span><span><span>电话：</span></span><span><span><span>027-87164677</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>材料科学与工程国际化示范学院（材料与微电子学院）：付</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span><span><span>电话：</span></span><span><span><span>027-87733690</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span>地址：湖北省武汉市洪山区珞狮路</span></span><span><span><span>122</span></span></span><span><span>号武汉理工大学马房山校区西院材料科学与工程学院</span></span><span><span>或</span></span><span><span>材料科学与工程国际化示范学院（材料与微电子学院）</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span>邮编：</span></span><span><span><span>430070</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>武汉理工大学材料科学与工程学院</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>12</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"49b1c907b6f23b566b4148042e406ed1c78e5c903bd007a72059fd555a96d320","textLength":1541,"sourceSha256":"13eda6baeff7387d16dbf26e85932389b5941c1fbf4d22f5c7fc9acc48edce06","selector":"article-like:list_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5a5ca86021464b3b41f9","title":"2025年武汉理工大学材料科学与工程学院2026年推荐免试攻读硕士学位（直接攻读博士学位）研究生招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:13.524426+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202509/W020250915693879206314.png","file":"assets/articles/media/c5d2a2c1b8a05832ef13.png"},{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202509/W020250915693879210105.png","file":"assets/articles/media/9c8171e6518eb558038c.png"}]}
